14d1t07.flac:e88f8a5fdf2bdd2e943aac53b937fc8f\r\njj2008-06-14d1t08.flac:a58c9caf4fb49ad02d9b3da544dfceed\r\njj2008-06-14d1t09.flac:336047d6d4c6ec72236a8092b5f02b04\r\njj2008-06-14d1t10.flac:982a83a03f8ec394c1a795e92f1d0d5f\r\njj2008-06-14d2t01.flac:d8dc436b2b334b1acb13becea1736304\r\njj2008-06-14d2t02.flac:e6f75a59c536a0a238f813bf569b3208\r\njj2008-06-14d2t03.flac:23aef3546295388af7d6ad2db6911330\r\njj2008-06-14d2t04.flac:31cbace4495f56a62e67db56dbfe8416\r\njj2008-06-14d2t05.flac:afdf78bc1a2501702c3b7172ce82228a\r\njj2008-06-14d2t06.flac:35f386990d5a1a1bb4d73c6c2ff4f4d1\r\njj2008-06-14d2t07.flac:4f94e2cf64e35cc686800cf4ba07f688\r\njj2008-06-14d2t08.flac:4e6700173700919b98969c1484984d6a\r\njj2008-06-14d2t09.flac:98f3361cf90ad8fae80658f760a9ba11\r\njj2008-06-14d2t10.flac:ffb410c6eedca103293686cb277d9619\r\njj2008-06-14d2t11.flac:77629573f187692c16b5353f64a244f4\r\njj2008-06-14d2t12.flac:42032898d93b37e8490da53709a7939d","notes":"$ = with Money Mark\n* = with Eddie Vedder\n\nIf any of the song titles are incorrect please let me know.","backup_location":"ia903602_2"},"reviews":[{"reviewbody":"My favorite show at Roo this year.  \"Constellations\" with Eddie is nice.","reviewtitle":"Thank You For This Show","reviewer":"moons","reviewdate":"2008-06-17 00:08:49","createdate":"2008-06-17 00:08:49","stars":"5"},{"reviewbody":"Some great shows this year, but this one tops 'em all... I was hoping at the concert that this would be uploaded soon - glad to see it has been.","reviewtitle":"Helluva show!","reviewer":"clemson","reviewdate":"2008-06-17 16:22:10","createdate":"2008-06-17 16:22:10","stars":"5"},{"reviewbody":"I had the pleasure of being at the opening show in Noblesville, Indiana 6/13/2008.  The set list, while reordered was very similar, except Better Together was stuck in with Angel toward the end of the show (someone posted on youtube if you are curious while it lasts).  \n\nThe first show he seemed behind on a lot of notes and lyrics, as expected.  Also, it had a much \"slower\" and jerkier flow between fast/slow songs.  He seemed to get a better feel at Bonnaroo at the recording quality of this show is superb.\n\nThank you for taking your time and effort to share with everyone.  It is appreciated beyond words.","reviewtitle":"Thanks!","reviewer":"thestaticfrost","reviewdate":"2008-06-18 14:54:08","createdate":"2008-06-18 14:54:08","stars":"5"},{"reviewbody":"This is the only set I was able to sneak into my buddy's VIP area right at the end of the lawn.  We drank from his keg and enjoyed this entire show!  I was amazed at the musicians who joined Jack and how well they meshed with him together.  One of the top moments of this year's Roo for me!","reviewtitle":"A must have!","reviewer":"MadeInJapan","reviewdate":"2008-06-19 02:17:44","createdate":"2008-06-19 02:17:44","stars":"5"},{"reviewbody":"What a set!!  and great quality recording way to go\n\nPerfect summer night at dusk.  Perfect weather laying in the grass at the What Stage listing to Jack play into darkness! .... it really was surreal, and anyone else that was there knows exactly what im talking about.\n\none little comment, the song titled 'false hope' is actually called \"Mother and Child Reunion\", its a cover Jack did of a Paul Simon song .... another awesomely ridiculous song if you have never heard Simon's version definitely check it out, promise you will not be disappointed","reviewtitle":"Brilliant!!!","reviewer":"OneBigHoliday_24","reviewdate":"2008-06-20 19:06:35","createdate":"2008-06-20 19:06:35","stars":"5"},{"reviewbody":"This is a stellar JJ set.  Great sound and great music.  I love the piano and drums with him.  Enough said.","reviewtitle":"stellar","reviewer":"Garcia-Kimock Fanatic!","reviewdate":"2008-06-22 21:23:42","createdate":"2008-06-22 21:23:42","stars":"5"},{"reviewbody":"this is a fun full band jack show. He starts off doing the first few songs solo, and having Money Mark and Eddie V do a few songs was fun too. Jack's setlists never really change from show to show so don't expect anything revolutionary in this recording, but it's a fun long show. A few covers thrown in there in song transitions as always, and everyone has a fun time. The sound / recording quality is good, esp for a festival environment. Thanks for recording / allowing streams!","reviewtitle":"Fun stuff","reviewer":"Tyler","reviewdate":"2008-06-23 20:44:01","createdate":"2008-06-23 20:44:01","stars":"3"},{"reviewbody":"Excellent recording.  Thanks for posting.  Probably the best sounding JJ show in the archive.","reviewtitle":"Great Show","reviewer":"KDCNOVA","reviewdate":"2008-06-25 14:54:42","createdate":"2008-06-25 14:54:42","stars":"5"},{"reviewbody":"Great recording.  One of the best I've heard.  1 small correction.  Track 9 is actually called Monsoon, not sooner or later.  Thanks and great job.","reviewtitle":"Wow!","reviewer":"lankfordunleashed","reviewdate":"2008-07-10 20:52:41","createdate":"2008-07-10 20:52:41","stars":"5"},{"reviewbody":"Thanks for giving me a little bit of Bonnaroo 08 to carry around and share with friends.  This is an amazing recording and everyone I share it with is impressed with its quality.","reviewtitle":"Quality recording.","reviewer":"mrdart","reviewdate":"2008-07-30 23:29:48","createdate":"2008-07-30 23:29:48","stars":"5"},{"reviewbody":"Well done, Brent. Great editing and mastership of a well-captured source. This is a nice update to my Jack Johnson collection which contains mostly shows from 2005 or so.","reviewtitle":"Sounds great","reviewer":"MaLaCoiD","reviewdate":"2008-08-03 14:15:09","createdate":"2008-08-03 14:15:09","stars":"5"},{"reviewbody":"this is a superb show from start to finish..listening to it right now at work :)","reviewtitle":"great recording","reviewer":"gratefulgreg22","reviewdate":"2010-04-14 19:56:38","createdate":"2010-04-14 19:56:38","stars":"5"},{"reviewbody":"sometimes I forget how much I enjoy J.Johnson, thanks for the reminder.","reviewtitle":"live","reviewer":"sfannie","reviewdate":"2010-05-08 06:59:20","createdate":"2010-05-08 06:59:20","stars":"4"},{"reviewbody":"I saw this show and it was a migical evening JJ, then Pearl Jam then Phil and Friends. I downloaded this recording when it was released and the quality is exelent. The PJ show you got was great too!","reviewtitle":"Great Recording","reviewer":"Frequincy","reviewdate":"2010-05-12 15:37:33","createdate":"2010-05-12 15:37:33","stars":"4"},{"reviewbody":"love this recording and show very crisp","reviewtitle":"Beautiful show","reviewer":"Loser_Boy","reviewdate":"2011-04-13 19:56:05","createdate":"2011-04-13 19:56:05","stars":"4"},{"reviewbody":"While one of my first, this is the best recording I've found so far. It's very clean and the crowd noise is minimal at the most. Great.","reviewtitle":"One of my first recordings from here","reviewer":"samc1213","reviewdate":"2011-04-25 23:37:00","createdate":"2011-04-25 23:37:00","stars":"5"},{"reviewbody":"nice upload, thanks!","reviewtitle":"great quality","reviewer":"mkitty","reviewdate":"2011-05-09 00:11:19","createdate":"2011-05-09 00:11:19","stars":"5"},{"reviewbody":"Good pull Brent. Hope you're doing well buddy.","reviewtitle":"way back when","reviewer":"ARBOER02","reviewdate":"2011-05-14 14:12:00","createdate":"2011-05-14 14:12:00","stars":"5"},{"reviewbody":"Does Shane Treacy,the sunflower man, play on this?","reviewtitle":"Yea","reviewer":"Lucy leave 896","reviewdate":"2012-08-27 09:27:18","createdate":"2012-08-27 09:27:18","stars":"1"},{"reviewbody":"Jack Johnson is Mellow Guy! Love this recording, would have love to have been here.\n\n<a href=\"http://www.lifestyleeurope.co.uk/suzuki/\" rel=\"ugc nofollow\">Used Suzuki Kent</a>","reviewtitle":"JJ is the best","reviewer":"kentsuzuki","reviewdate":"2013-08-28 15:14:13","createdate":"2013-08-28 15:14:13","stars":"4"},{"reviewbody":"Hey, he really rocked this festival, it's great to have the crowd noises in, it helps to grasp the feeling of the gig\nBesides that, the recording quality is A+\n\nThank you so much, you big ol' sharer, you !","reviewtitle":"Many thanks for sharing the love !","reviewer":"SecretSmoker","reviewdate":"2016-03-31 22:39:08","createdate":"2016-03-31 22:39:08","stars":"5"},{"reviewtitle":"https://support.google.com/android/thread/362853422?hl=id","reviewbody":"Responden fungsional ","stars":"5","reviewer":"Risdi Anto","reviewdate":"2026-05-17 00:55:24","createdate":"2026-05-17 00:55:24","reviewer_itemname":"@risdi_anto"}],"server":"ia600609.us.archive.org","uniq":1456941341,"workable_servers":["ia600609.us.archive.org","ia800609.us.archive.org"]}